message: "If you use this simulator, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Eval Planner: will your comparison of two agents give a trustworthy answer?"
abstract: "An interactive Monte Carlo simulator showing how eight design hazards in LLM-agent experiments bias estimated effects and inflate false-positive rates, each paired with the check that catches it. All data are simulated."
